      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm trying to run this macro for our monthly reconciliation but it keeps crashing mid-way. im getting \"Run-time error '1004': Application-defined or object-defined error\" on this line:\n\nSub MonthlyRecon()\n    Dim ws As Worksheet\n    Set ws = ThisWorkbook.Sheets(\"Reconciliation_Report\")\n    ws.Range(\"A1:Z100\").Value = DataArray\n    ws.Range(\"A1\").Select\nEnd Sub\n\ncan u help me fix this? i need it working by end of day",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
